{"id":"fu_nfzehn","lemma":"fünfzehn","pos":"num","rank":4997,"glosses":["fifteen"],"ipa":"/ˈfʏnft͡seːn/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/87/De-f%C3%BCnfzehn.ogg/De-f%C3%BCnfzehn.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ich habe weniger als fünfzehn.","en":"I have less than fifteen.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"less"},{"g":"at the same moment"},null]},{"text":"Ich bin in fünfzehn Minuten da.","en":"I'll be there in fifteen minutes.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"minute (unit of time","l":"Minute"},{"g":"there"}]},{"text":"Wir waren damals erst fünfzehn Jahre alt.","en":"At the time, we were just fifteen years old.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"at that time"},{"g":"first, at first"},null,{"g":"year","l":"Jahr"},{"g":"old"}]},{"text":"Drei mal fünf ist fünfzehn.","en":"3 times 5 is 15.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/139409","words":[{"g":"three (numerical value…"},{"g":"just / once"},{"g":"five (numerical value…"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Sie hat nicht mehr als fünfzehn Dollar.","en":"She has no more than fifteen dollars.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"more"},{"g":"at the same moment"},null,{"g":"dollar"}]}]}